  Opened by the open button of Custom corners in the Quick Draw window (it closes with 7, the
  Lisp shows this one: Dyl:QuickDrawBandDialog of Apps\Draw\Dyl-QuickDraw.lsp), on the
  behaviors of the preset shown. OK gives them to every preset selected. The keys are the
  tiles of *mt:bandwindows* (Remote\Dyl-Materials.lsp): mco the corners (mco/vals: the keys
  of *mt:corners*), mml the miter limit (Mitered), mlt the segment through a lap (Lapped),
  mjo the joints; greyed out unless the corners picked use them, or Ask when drawn.
